  (nk-in-set outs n0 (nk-n o) out ≡ true) →
  (nk-out-ok ins outs n0 (nk-n o) o ≡ true) →
  nk-out-ok ins outs n0 (nk-n o) (nk-build t e out o) ≡ true
nk-build-wf (nk-var i) ins outs n0 e out (nk-out fx n ws) p0 he hout ho =
